<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#e8eff0">
    <title>机器人岗位技能图谱 · JobTrending</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/robotics.css">
    <script src="/robotics.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="shell">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="/robotics" aria-label="机器人技能图谱首页">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span>
          <span>JobTrending <strong>技能图谱</strong></span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="主导航">
          <a class="nav-current" href="/robotics" aria-current="page">技能看板</a>
          <a href="/jobs">职位列表</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="intro-copy">
          <h1 id="page-title">先看岗位需求，<br>再安排练习。</h1>
          <p>从 BOSS 职位详情中提取的 50 项机器人技能。按被提及的岗位数排序，点开即可查看练习目标和原文依据。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-aside">
          <div class="sample-main"><strong id="sample-count">—</strong><span>份纳入统计的机器人相关岗位</span></div>
          <div class="sample-meta"><span id="sample-date">数据加载中</span><span>每个岗位对每项技能只计一次</span></div>
          <div class="sample-rule">提及次数表示本次样本中的出现次数，不代表全国招聘占比。</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <main>
        <section class="workspace" aria-label="技能浏览">
          <div class="explorer">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <h2>技能需求</h2>
                <p>先浏览高频项，再按方向缩小范围。</p>
              </div>
              <span class="result-count" id="result-count"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="controls">
              <label class="search-field">
                <span class="search-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="sr-only">搜索技能</span>
                <input id="skill-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索 ROS 2、传感器、仿真…" autocomplete="off">
              </label>
              <div class="category-strip" id="category-strip" role="group" aria-label="按技能方向筛选"></div>
              <label class="progress-filter"><input type="checkbox" id="pending-only"><span>只看待练习</span></label>
            </div>

            <div class="axis-heading"><span>按岗位提及次数排序</span><span>岗位数 / <span id="axis-total">—</span></span></div>
            <div class="skill-list" id="skill-list" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <button class="show-more" id="show-more" type="button" hidden>再看 8 项技能</button>
          </div>

          <aside class="detail" id="skill-detail" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="detail-loading">正在读取技能证据…</div>
          </aside>
        </section>

        <section class="method" aria-label="样本与统计说明">
          <div>
            <h2>统计口径</h2>
            <p>范围为上海、深圳的机器人关键词岗位。只统计详情至少 120 字、且经逐条审核确认工作内容与机器人相关的岗位；尚未审核的计入“待审核”，不参与技能计数。技能必须出现在详情原文中。数据随补抓与审核实时更新。练习项由岗位要求转化，不是招聘方原话。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="method-figures" id="method-figures"></div>
          <p class="date-limit">BOSS 未提供可核验的首次发布日期。本页仅确认职位在采集日可见，无法证明它们在最近半年首次发布。</p>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer>JobTrending · BOSS 直聘机器人岗位技能调研</footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
